# Local agent config + internal-only folders (kept on local disk, NOT published to GitHub):
# ignore most of .claude, the internal horosa-dev dev-skill guide, and the whole .github folder
# (CI workflows + issue/PR templates). The horosa-dev skill still loads locally from disk.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/horosa-dev/
.claude/settings.local.json
/.github/

# ── Windows repo = BUILD HARNESS ONLY (committed policy — was previously hidden in
#    .git/info/exclude, which is per-clone and unshared; making it explicit here so the
#    intent is documented + identical on every clone). ─────────────────────────────────
# The product source under local/workspace/ (astrostudyui / astropy / astrostudysrv /
# vendor) and the embedded runtime are NOT tracked. The product source is built locally
# from the Mac repo (re-clone + wholesale-replace per .claude/skills/horosa-dev/SKILL.md);
# the runtime is regenerated by prepareruntime/Prepare_Runtime_Windows.ps1. The small set
# of Windows-only adaptations (umi-runner.js, loadCryptoDeps.js, scripts/vendor,
# windowSizePersistence isDesktopShellWindow, pages/index ensureField, requirements
# flatlib-strip, THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES placement, package.json build scripts) is preserved
# + deterministically re-appliable from the tracked windows-adaptations/ overlay, so a
# workspace wipe can never lose them again. (local/Horosa_Local_Windows.{ps1,bat} stay
# tracked — they live directly under local/, not local/workspace/.)
/local/workspace/

# Bundled runtimes (too large for regular Git push) — subsumed by /local/workspace/ above,
# kept for clarity + legacy-path compatibility
local/workspace/runtime/mac/java/
local/workspace/runtime/mac/python/
local/workspace/runtime/self-check/
local/workspace/runtime/windows/appcds/
local/workspace/runtime/windows/java/
local/workspace/runtime/windows/maven/
local/workspace/runtime/windows/node/
local/workspace/runtime/windows/python/
local/workspace/runtime/windows/wheels/
local/workspace/runtime/windows/bundle/astrostudyboot.jar
local/workspace/runtime/windows/bundle/wheels/

# Legacy path compatibility
runtime/mac/java/
runtime/mac/python/
runtime/windows/java/
runtime/windows/maven/
runtime/windows/node/
runtime/windows/python/
runtime/windows/wheels/
runtime/windows/bundle/astrostudyboot.jar
runtime/windows/bundle/wheels/

